# LAB5-id: e1m1's sky from id's intermission corner, looking up, in real time; id's sky,
# its clouds moving in steps.
#
# Under V3-32: "The clouds used to jump eight times a second. Now they drift."
#
# Assembly (LAB5): the 470x520 crops at (700,40) of LAB5-id and LAB5-slop, enlarged 2x
# (nearest), side by side at (13,20) and (967,20) of a black 1920x1080 frame, labelled
# "id's" and "slop".

map e1m1

duration 7
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_fluidsky 0

camera fixed -112,704,56 -30,45

sound off
events on
